"ar putea fi măsurate și cu ce probabilitate. Importăm aici Sampler-ul Qiskit"
" Runtime:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have exhausted your allotted time on real quantum computers or if you"
" are without an internet connection, you may prefer to use a simulator. To "
